How to Navigate Between Commits
1. Go back to any specific commit (read-only / detached HEAD):
powershell


git checkout <commit_hash>
Example:

powershell


git checkout 4d8f15a
2. Return back to the latest commit on main:
powershell


git checkout main
3. Jump directly between any two commits:
powershell


git checkout <target_commit_hash>
